        "description": "One MICHELIN Guide restaurant: name, link, stars, distinction and award year, Green Star flag, cuisine, price, currency, payment methods, street address, city, postal code, region, country, coordinates, phone, website, reservations flag, language, the inspector's review excerpt with its date, description, classification, facilities and opening hours where listed, and image.\n\nEvery response includes `credits_used`: the credits this call cost.\n\nPrice: 1 credit per successful call. Docs: https://api.sh/docs/michelin-restaurant",
        "tags": [
          "MICHELIN Guide"
        ],
        "x-credits": 1,
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "url",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
